    "extraction_notes": [
      "The 4882 is specified as a dual N-channel MOSFET; this extraction uses polarity n. The datasheet's electrical values are per MOSFET channel unless otherwise stated.",
      "RDS(on) maximums are 0.022 ohm at VGS = 10 V, ID = 8 A and 0.035 ohm at VGS = 4.5 V, ID = 5 A.",
      "Total gate charge is 12 nC with QGS = 3.2 nC and QGD = 3.1 nC at VDS = 20 V, ID = 8 A, VGS endpoint 10 V.",
      "The datasheet also publishes typical normalized breakdown voltage and normalized on-resistance versus junction temperature, safe operating area, and transient thermal impedance curves.",
      "Curve points are manual digitizations from the typical performance figures and preserve the stated temperature and bias semantics."
    ],
